{"title":"2014 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 9","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_9\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 9</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Solution_5\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 5</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(CREATIVE_THINKING)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (CREATIVE THINKING)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_9\">Problem 9</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 9\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For real numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/e/9ee4b825a2e36ae093ed7be5e4851ef453b34914.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$w$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/a/69a1b108beb9e11391b1e636b5839f88ac0d9af1.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\cfrac{\\frac{1}{w} + \\frac{1}{z}}{\\frac{1}{w} - \\frac{1}{z}} = 2014.\\]\" width=\"111\" height=\"47\" /> What is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/6/1c62958e42423d619fa08c60bf6e4cb0f4ccd93e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{w+z}{w-z}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"47\" height=\"35\" />? \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/f/ebf0351de397d1c6aa82fcd3f27b2829eb2d61e3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }-2014\\qquad\\textbf{(B) }\\frac{-1}{2014}\\qquad\\textbf{(C) }\\frac{1}{2014}\\qquad\\textbf{(D) }1\\qquad\\textbf{(E) }2014$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"492\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Multiply the numerator and denominator of the LHS (left hand side) by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/8/3480aca46138a454bb35084317f530e672388798.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$wz$\" width=\"22\" height=\"8\" /> to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/4/4a4855e08ff9b34492e9de05f68f93663cce8493.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{z+w}{z-w}=2014$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"109\" height=\"35\" />. Then since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/6/0d6ec3cb77c32e3bdcf4a647346a38c5c69df80b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z+w=w+z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"113\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/8/5e852f683d3115dd729c079a7a66ef67f9c9a4ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$w-z=-(z-w)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"141\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/9/ba921346443142a5d3d5e7e1837cb9e035de1e88.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{w+z}{w-z}=-\\frac{z+w}{z-w}=-2014$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"210\" height=\"35\" />, or choice <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/e/f6eb65962292d994ce2f9a8af63728883f256b18.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{A}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"27\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Basic algebra at the end of the day, so simplify the numerator and the denominator. The numerator simplifies out to \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/5/f45fbd065dd25e81af602ba139031906115278a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{w+z}{wz}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"51\" height=\"37\" /> and the denominator simplifies out to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/2/032497ba637896a87508ac09140228d9bb0c7940.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{z-w}{wz}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"51\" height=\"37\" />. \n</p><p>This results in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/1/69130725b1f34de2ac2e08f5e912811c3d73f413.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cfrac{\\frac{w+z}{zw}}{\\frac{z-w}{zw}} = 2014$\" style=\"vertical-align: -20px\" width=\"96\" height=\"48\" />. \n</p><p>Division results in the elimination of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/3/c238a0e2fe6d3fd49d5219a4b5fabdbf6b5fb4f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$zw$\" width=\"22\" height=\"8\" />, so we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/9/8a918468eb2158606aa456c0971c84a1c945b6a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{w+z}{z-w} = 2014$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"111\" height=\"39\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/5/eb507f217b57ac51d298ec8ad02e629d84bf7371.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z-w$\" width=\"44\" height=\"8\" /> is just <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/7/a573611f60256a187972112b20e73f343d41b8c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-(w-z)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"75\" height=\"20\" /> so the equation above is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/e/53ee66e7f4484df796c12497975bd9ef74e42274.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-(\\frac{w+z}{w-z} = 2014$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"133\" height=\"39\" />.\n</p><p>Solving this results in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/5/3655862ea5c6206f14b71fd1ded6d7c29a3aa426.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{w+z}{w-z} = \\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}\\ -2014}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"180\" height=\"39\" />.\n</p><p>~AkCANdo\n~minor edit by SwordAxe\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Muliply both sides by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/9/0b91f251ca7798b41589c93715183d225d7c29a4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left(\\frac{1}{w}-\\frac{1}{z}\\right)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"81\" height=\"45\" /> to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/9/cd996bf56235b0d1b28922f8721768e8c9bb7c01.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{w}+\\frac{1}{z}=2014\\left(\\frac{1}{w}-\\frac{1}{z}\\right)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"198\" height=\"45\" />. Then, add <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/2/ea216cb7a370fcb3d1597149ee092f44e5ff85f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2014\\cdot\\frac{1}{z}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"65\" height=\"38\" /> to both sides and subtract <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/f/49f938eb6a7f2ead77b10e91363a4e3e08af7f40.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{w}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"16\" height=\"37\" /> from both sides to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/1/db1e15c09ffafa76b037dd0758a70dcb317bf5b5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2015\\cdot\\frac{1}{z}=2013\\cdot\\frac{1}{w}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"156\" height=\"38\" />. Then, we can plug in the most simple values for z and w (<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/c/b7c41d5d55f66cd4a292a064c28c0c679742c8a6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2015$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"35\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/a/2fa725c98dfe19f98809033755b801810bc298aa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2013$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"35\" height=\"13\" />, respectively), and find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/c/f5cc6127303da092eef966d08b4e8965d1ec3813.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2013+2015}{2013-2015}=\\frac{2(2014)}{-2}=-2014$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"263\" height=\"42\" />, or answer choice <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/e/f6eb65962292d994ce2f9a8af63728883f256b18.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{A}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"27\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4\">Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/4/634402c9f04796505c159e82bc2fa32441735185.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = \\frac{1}{w}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"53\" height=\"38\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/c/a2c7ba723ebd62a4596a39037f6db05def437d90.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = \\frac{1}{z}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"47\" height=\"38\" />. To find values for a and b, we can try <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/9/9e9551da876217b4c7b1b09aa86474180d6b96a2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b = 2014$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"102\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/0/ca0ac3cd47823ab124237d607ea3796c5c4e70a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a-b=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"72\" height=\"13\" />. However, that leaves us with a fractional solution, so scaling it by 2, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/4/f3482a90e4454168418fb78660f740272a3c54fc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b = 4028$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"102\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/3/9c3af692cc93cdd87ec76bb01f433b98e5be69d8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a-b=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"75\" height=\"16\" />. Solving by adding the equations together, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/e/a0eecdef247cea5ed9993da7a1706375f753583e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 2015$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"70\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/2/aa24938ad1e3144578638f5f632eac0bc202c393.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 2013$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"72\" height=\"14\" />. Now, substituting back in, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/1/901007fa6efdfe15d2e49cbf50983359798d8237.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$w = \\frac{1}{2015}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"80\" height=\"38\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/a/f8aef81f2a1a2be74769232c2f0e0222791f5db3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z = \\frac{1}{2013}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"76\" height=\"38\" />. Now, putting this into the desired equation with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/c/e6c8a6596d641487711d4d1c1bf1154fcc1f6a12.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = 2015 \\cdot 2013$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"123\" height=\"14\" /> (since it will cancel out), we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/9/3190fd3859d18bbc8d8b46cd5586f8f5ac4031df.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\frac{2013+2015}{n}}{\\frac{2013-2015}{n}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -20px\" width=\"73\" height=\"49\" />. Dividing, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/2/352c9fb8fabe6c40692d093389910dd55d4ed49b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{4028}{-2} = \\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}\\ -2014}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"171\" height=\"40\" />.\n</p><p>~idk12345678\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_5\">Solution 5</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 5\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Set \\( w = 2 \\) and \\( z = 1 \\).\n</p><p>Substitute the new values into the first equation \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/a/1ca4c58d061c033fa8979a78d27afd4885c00002.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{2} + 1 = \\frac{3}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"84\" height=\"38\" />,\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/b/94be8291479160c9556f96500837f12161390499.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{2} - 1 = -\\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"98\" height=\"38\" />,\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/a/79a91f29ce07f70bc73e95b0a434bd06002f2edc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\frac{3}{2} / \\frac{-1}{2}} = -3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"78\" height=\"42\" />\n</p><p>Substitute in the second equation with new values of \\( w \\) and \\( z \\):\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/9/a99014c0128fac407d152e0b963d817041835df8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2 + 1}{2 - 1} = 3.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"85\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p>Answers of each equation (where X is the quotient): <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/9/52969fdeeb90f7e24cd2a2f1a6cfe124776fee2a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"26\" height=\"14\" /> \n</p><p>Therefore, the answers to the equations are the negatives of each other. Thus the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/4/70432e471002b1c1f363f2d085b0f3dff8d930a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{(A)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"39\" height=\"29\" />\n</p><p><br />\n~WalkEmDownTrey\n~minor <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/c/2ac513632853af495d413f35d04f85427ad572ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$latex$\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" /> edits by SwordAxe\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28CREATIVE_THINKING.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(CREATIVE_THINKING)\">Video Solution (CREATIVE THINKING)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (CREATIVE THINKING)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/Y37KozgBEXg\">https://youtu.be/Y37KozgBEXg</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/6Uh77bue0bE\">https://youtu.be/6Uh77bue0bE</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10B\" title=\"2014 AMC 10B\">2014 AMC 10B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10B_Problems\" title=\"2014 AMC 10B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2014 AMC 10B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;b